Third-party components
======================

- Crispy Heretic, part of Crispy Doom 7.2, copyright 1993-1996 id Software,
  1993-2008 Raven Software, 2005-2014 Simon Howard and the Chocolate Doom
  and Crispy Doom authors, GNU GPL version 2 or later
  (engine/crispy-heretic.js and engine/crispy-heretic.wasm; license text in
  engine/COPYING.md). Built from the crispy-doom-7.2 tag of
  https://github.com/fabiangreffrath/crispy-doom with the changes in
  tools/doom/crispy-web.patch (a game loop driven by the browser, gamepad
  input, autosave and quit hooks for the page). The complete source of the
  build, with those changes applied, is in
  engine/crispy-doom-7.2-web-src.tar.gz; it is compiled with Emscripten
  4.0.10 by tools/build-doom.mjs in https://github.com/RobertPKyle/frunk-store.

  The build includes SDL 2.32.0 and SDL_mixer 2.8.0 (zlib License), from
  Emscripten's ports, and the Nuked OPL3 emulator that is part of
  Crispy Doom's source (GNU LGPL version 2.1 or later).

